'''Nidoking''' (Japanese: '''ニドキング''' ''Nidoking'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

