==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Nidoking|59}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Nidoking}}.
*'''Poison Horn''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Weedle|S1}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 1}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

